msgstr "<p class=\"description\">Deletes WSS slots from draft, private and trashed products, as well as published hidden/archived products, and disables their WSS Bookings flags. WooCommerce orders and the products themselves are not deleted.</p>"

#: wss-woocommerce-bookings.php
msgid "<p><strong>Неактивных/архивных товаров с WSS-слотами/меткой:</strong> "
msgstr "<p><strong>Inactive/archived products with WSS slots or flags:</strong> "

